Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lordeo, we'll get a new body for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excerpt from the December 4th,\N1888 edition of the London Press.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been reported that 73\Nof the 452 residents in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,town of Wind Knight's lot\Nhave gone missing overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:01:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police have been pursuing lines of\Ninquiry based on certain witness accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These accounts state that\Nfour outsiders were seen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,burning a man's clothing at\Nthe base of a nearby cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the four was\Nreportedly wielding a large
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hammer and using it to\Nsmash a curious stone mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our work here is done.
