Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.05,0:02:37.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll die! I'll go!
