Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.98,0:02:54.49,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\fad(750,0)\pos(1300,830)}Episode 9: "The Final Ripple!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heir to the Joestar fortune,\NJonathan Joestar weds Arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only daughter of the Pendletons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple will travel to the Americas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blazes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what time it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their ship's about to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Speedwagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost missed being\Nable to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both on board the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about ready to sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Father Sticks, we expect to hear\Ngreat things from your mission to Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll certainly do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.74,0:03:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes this thing so\Nblasted heavy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been hired by that Asian\Nbloke, so we move it where he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, did you boys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit flapping your blasted cake hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't get paid till this job's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ruddy hooligans! Mr. Speedwagon? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they're up there. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you a long, love-filled life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever need me, just call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, at the moment, I'd\Njust be in the way, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a wonderful trip!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.37,0:05:13.83,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\fad(840,0)\pos(960,827)\bord3\blur2}- The Atlantic Ocean, En Route To America -
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.37,0:05:13.83,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\fad(840,0)\pos(960,827)}- The Atlantic Ocean, En Route To America -
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor little bird all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you lose your flop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, love?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear, what are you crying about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These tears that I'm crying are from joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joy that I am here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as a boy, you strove\Nto be a true gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a champion of others, no matter\Nthe consequence to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that proud and noble\NJonathan Joestar is here in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my heart was frozen in despair, you\Nwarmed me and brought me back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am fortunate to have saved\Na world that has you in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only wish Father could have known you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supper's waiting. Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I wanted to tell you to be careful\Nso you wouldn't bash your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that today would last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It fell into the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a filthy place to go after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could just sell it, but\Nit brings in the shackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You surely do seem to enjoy picking on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't the experience\Ndrinking Amanda's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barely enough to get the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really isn't strong at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to our cabin, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to lock the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's rather strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lock's undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queer bit of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see a metal catch\Nglinting on the inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That this trunk is locked from the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan is so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:09:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, do you see the condition\Nin which I find myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a reason I display\Nmyself to you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I show my weakness\Nto my deadliest foe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because though I once despised you,\Nnow I have only the greatest respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your spirit, your valor\Nin battle, your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How incredible you are, Tio. Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not for you, I would never have\Nobtained the power of the Stone Mask.
