Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am certain that our fates were\Nbound together for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our two existences were only\Never intended to be but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so I will take the body of\Nthe only man on earth I respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I will live in eternal glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that is the destiny\Nwhich is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be no pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the final gift I bequeath to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, those eyes, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live on as my body, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a pity you wouldn't hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you had remained\Nstill as I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:11:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death, in fact, would\Nhave been quite painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Torn from your little\Nfairy tale into hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrust into a reality\Nyou didn't know existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Jojo never tell you of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evil that dwells there in the darkness\NI may not look like much right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but surely you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran Pendleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's Iran Joestar\Nnow, isn't it? Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's full of monsters!
