Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you ordered, Lord, I drained\Nthe life of only one passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now most of the ship has\Njoined our little family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we will proceed to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Lord Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lorena.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.81,0:12:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lorena!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to save.
