Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how the mighty have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sniveling whelp can't\Neven draw a proper breath now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, he'll be causing no more\Nmischief with his Hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what he gets for\Ncrossing you, Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we are going to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'll just sit quietly and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while he suffocates slowly, ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, Wang Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There shall be no insult to Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the one man capable of\Nbringing me to the apex of my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will show him all\Nthe respect which is due
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to him by severing his\Nhead in a painless manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The body of my dearest foe has\Nbecome my future! Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up to something. Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might have one last trick\Nup his muscle-bound sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bah, he's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio overestimates his mighty power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Jonathan Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll scoop out what little brains\Nyou have with my bare fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must save Arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to use the last bit of\Nhormone left in me all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wang Chen, look out!
