Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something broke inside my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something important what have you done
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end, the last Harmon I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too weak to destroy that zombie\Ncompletely, but it was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he playing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo has interfered with Wang Chen's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disrupting its functions without\Nbringing it to complete destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's made it seize tightly\Nonto a piece of machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:15:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the device it clings to so\Nimmovably is the paddle's screw shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strength of a zombie is\Nsufficient to arrest the paddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the shaft is stopped, steam pressure\Nin the piston will build up inexorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under such conditions,\Nthere is but one end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship will explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave, Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon the ship will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how the things that\Nare occurring today are possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all too impossible to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know whether I\Nshould cry or scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should just faint\Ndead away and block it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is one thing I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran Joestar will remain with her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the warmth of these lips I\Nfeel the cool ebbing of his life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joe Star is dying But we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are together I want to stay like this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until the ship explodes and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,burns to ash until everything is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright if you cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you have to stay alive and go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like in a storybook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to come to the aid of a\Nhelpless child and escape to safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sheer cruelty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that I want is\Nto end my life here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman died trying to\Nsave her child until the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My own mother did the same thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the baby. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your plan is to destroy\Nthis vessel, is it Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never give up or give\Nin, no matter the odds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But know this, determination\Nis not just in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no one who can defy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take your body as my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zombies hither!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devour Wang Chen's body and\Nrestart the piston. Once you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already blown apart,\Nbut there's still a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was protecting myself from\Nthe sun's rays well before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let it explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already have everything\NI need to survive.
