Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since Jojo can no longer use his ham on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remove his head and\Ntake his body as my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I shall walk over and\Nlie down in my velvet boudoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That humble shelter is\Nmarvelously constructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could withstand a ton of dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And welcome to you, my new eternal body!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you observed, it may be true\Nthat our fate is to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel an odd warmth for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, our lives are interwoven completely\Nand will end along with this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell to you, my beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of what we two can achieve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd like a taste of\Neternity, would you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can heal your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Iran can live together forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.49,0:20:22.45,JojoDiesSoSadSoSoSad ;_;,,0,0,0,,{\be7\fad(450,0)\pos(60,1020)}February 7th, 1889\N\NJonathan Joestar passes away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar passed away\Ninto undeserved oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His life was an important part of\Nhistory, but invisible to ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of humanity for whom he sacrificed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will never know of his\Nnoble accomplishments,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his descendants will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The life within me, newly created by Jonathan\Nand I, will certainly hear his story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena Joestar was soon rescued\Nafloat near the Canary Islands,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Book of the Stone\NMask was closed for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that was only the beginning\Nof a new, bizarre adventure.
